  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "தனதாகத் தான்கொடான் தாயத் தவரும்\nதமதாய போழ்தே கொடாஅர் - தனதாக\nமுன்னே கொடுப்பின் அவர்கடியார் தான்கடியான்\nபின்னை அவர்கொடுக்கும் போழ்து.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Nothing but his own churlishness hinders the churl from being liberal. While it was his he gave not; and his heirs, how it is theirs, give not. Before, while it was his, if he had given, they would not have reproved (him); and afterwards, if they had given, he would not have reproved them! Men's own avarice is the sole reason for the lack of charity.",
